<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Tambang Timah says net 1996 up.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Tambang Timah says net 1996 up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales					 607.9  vs  502.2</p>
<p>    Gross profit				264.3  vs  224.9</p>
<p>    Operating income			  183.2  vs  140.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income			    219.9  vs  188.9</p>
<p>    Net profit				  156.6  vs  134.5</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	  311  vs    267</p>
<p>Note : The results were audited. PT Tambang Timah is an integrated tin mining firm.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
